cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Paxeer X Network, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: Paxeer X Network
abstract: >-
  Paxeer X Network is a distributed HyperState Machine for payments, code
  execution and intent routing. It is one BFT network with EVM chain ID 125;
  the LayerX kernel is embedded in the paxd node and participates in block
  proposal and deterministic execution.
authors:
  - name: Sidiora Labs
version: v6.12.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Sidiora-Labs/paxeer-monorepo
url: https://paxeer.network
